Commit-Queue: Justin Lulejian <jlulejian@chromium.org>
Auto-Submit: Justin Lulejian <jlulejian@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1729278}

Electron adaptation notes (43-x-y): chrome/browser/extensions/api/mime_handlers/mime_handler_apitest.cc does not exist on this branch; the test-only hunk is not carried. Electron's PDF viewer uses extension_misc::kPdfExtensionId, which stays allowlisted. This branch's tools/json_schema_compiler/feature_compiler.py only accepts hex-encoded SHA1 hashes in feature allowlists (SHA-256 support is newer), so the five SHA-256 entries of the mimeHandlerPrivate allowlist are not carried; the SHA1 entries for the same extensions (including PDF) are kept.

